{"language":"cn","values":[["/names/cn","雷内亚"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名追求秩序的恶魔，能使用空间魔法将敌人送入另一维度的空间。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","世界需要均等。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","The world needs balance."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","完美之上还有更加完美。"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","There are things more perfect than perfection."],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","保持平衡，保持对称。"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Preserve balance, maintain harmony."],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","失衡……让人作呕……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","Disorder... is... disgusting..."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","完美无需强调。"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","Perfection needs no emphasis."],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","无可挑剔的对称，无可挑剔的完美。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","均衡完美。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","背面之姿同样美丽。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","前左后右，前右后左，完成。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","完美无缺的均衡，绝对均衡的完美。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","勉强平衡，可以更好。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","神的作品，毫无美感。"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","黄金比例的花纹，不错"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","真是完美无缺的艺术品"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","完美的圆形蛋糕，棒极了"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","雪花是完美的造物"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","真是完美无缺的艺术品"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","一片雪花，两片雪花……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","灯笼，如此对称……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","大部分焰火都很美丽"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","雷内亚连名字都是完美对称。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","雷内亚厌恶大部分生命，因为他们只有一颗心脏，还总长在旁边。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","雷内亚无法成为一个好的研究者，因为他厌恶一切不够“美丽”的图形、数字甚至公式。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","雷内亚厌恶许多东西，但最为讨厌的还是奇数、混乱和随机——这让他讨厌贝利尔甚至胜过厌恶大部分半神。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","曾经有不愿公开姓名的恶魔透露过，雷内亚其实有严重的洁癖，这也是他为什么总是飘在半空中而不落地的缘故。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","雷内亚爱极了完美的圆，但恨透了圆周率。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","金穗村曾经有村民找骑士团报案：一夜之间自己的美丽麦田里出现了很多同心圆。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","曾经有过这样的一次报案：有位身材极其健美的骑士在晚上对镜欣赏自己的肌肉时，发现镜子里的自己变成了四手的怪物——而且怪物的肌肉更漂亮。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","雷内亚身上的装饰是他亲手绘制，每一笔都丝毫不差。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","雷内亚最喜欢的天气是下雪天，因为每一片雪花都是无比精妙的对称——而在雪化成无法分割的水的时候，他的心情就会异常恶劣。"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","可惜，何等可惜！只差一厘，你就是完美的形态！"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415709.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","雷内亚 & 梅希拉"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","真是个好日子，对吧？是个非常适合做坏事的天气吧？就在这种非常不合衬的光天化日之下！"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415021.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","贝利尔 & 雷内亚"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","美，应当是漂浮无定的。"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415030.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","普鲁斯托 & 雷内亚"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","黄金比例的花纹，不错"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415150.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","雷内亚"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","完美的圆形蛋糕，棒极了"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415151.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","雷内亚"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","雪花是完美的造物"],["/i